# Temperature and Humidity Sensor

## Aim
To measure temperature and humidity using DHT11 sensor.

## Components Required
- Raspberry Pi 4 Model B
- DHT11 Temperature and Humidity Sensor
- Jumper Wires

## Programming Language
Python

## Description
This project uses a DHT11 sensor connected to Raspberry Pi 4B to measure temperature and humidity.

## Result
Temperature and humidity values are displayed successfully.
